{"title":"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that for every positive reals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0efef50d55ce420ab06ff37c3dba91936fa7e612.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {1}{(1 + \\sqrt {x})^{2}} + \\frac {1}{(1 + \\sqrt {y})^{2}} \\ge \\frac {2}{x + y + 2}.\\]\" width=\"289\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cauchy-Schwarz_Inequality\" title=\"Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality\">Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/37486bc56dadb60878744149b0cfd554608b2a8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+1)(1+x) \\ge (1 + \\sqrt{x})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"211\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/5/6252b22574f6ac5ef1dfe400ed47b7126a1c6d30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+1)(1+y) \\ge  (1 + \\sqrt{y})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"210\" height=\"20\" />, with equality happening in the earlier inequality when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> and equality happening in the latter inequality when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0517387c7374eb6cfeae1fb2084bf2b52a7303.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/3642256384ce88ee23008994296fbf75cae21e51.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{1}{(1 + \\sqrt{x})^2} &amp;\\ge \\frac{1}{2+2x} \\\\ \\frac{1}{(1 + \\sqrt{y})^2} &amp;\\ge \\frac{1}{2+2y} \\\\ \\frac{1}{(1 + \\sqrt{x})^2} + \\frac{1}{(1 + \\sqrt{y})^2} &amp;\\ge \\frac12 \\cdot (\\frac{1}{1+x} + \\frac{1}{1+y}). \\end{align*}\" width=\"365\" height=\"140\" />\nBy the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AM-GM_Inequality\" title=\"AM-GM Inequality\">AM-GM Inequality</a>, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/907e195cba322c82cfc6a985e29e21fd13b92d96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12 \\cdot (\\frac{1}{1+x} + \\frac{1}{1+y}) \\ge \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{(1+x)(1+y)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"310\" height=\"53\" />.  For the equality case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/7894f3a9a3d60043be1583b13e5961ae3ad347b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1+x} = \\frac{1}{1+y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"113\" height=\"40\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e33fa7c7b2ce1a18e6e0a6d3ef6c08bd1958722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />.  Additionally, by the AM-GM Inequality, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/2/a42760d6e6b69a939fa9a3f8d46503ed5b45cec3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12 \\cdot (\\frac{x+1}{2} + \\frac{y+1}{2}) \\ge \\sqrt{\\frac{(x+1)(y+1)}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"312\" height=\"45\" />.  For the equality case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/8766b4222871d4047f4f3a0535169c86cc8b2e52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+1}{2} = \\frac{y+1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"113\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e33fa7c7b2ce1a18e6e0a6d3ef6c08bd1958722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />.  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/4/974cf2c4e28c63f849fa5ed5a430043b3f57e64d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/5/115c2404488a534a4a0755cca24c8e79fb59f5db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac12 \\cdot (\\frac{x+y+2}{2}) &amp;\\ge \\frac{\\sqrt{(x+1)(y+1)}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{x+y+2}{2} &amp;\\ge \\sqrt{(x+1)(y+1)} \\\\ \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{(x+1)(y+1)}} &amp;\\ge \\frac{2}{x+y+2}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"286\" height=\"144\" />\nTherefore, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/b/5fbf4243faa30664a47f9774134cf73d88a73e19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{(1 + \\sqrt{x})^2} + \\frac{1}{(1 + \\sqrt{y})^2} \\ge \\frac12 \\cdot (\\frac{1}{1+x} + \\frac{1}{1+y})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"362\" height=\"43\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/907e195cba322c82cfc6a985e29e21fd13b92d96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12 \\cdot (\\frac{1}{1+x} + \\frac{1}{1+y}) \\ge \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{(1+x)(1+y)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"310\" height=\"53\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/1/c71421d9e3c1946cd87137df989a9abf795f6d27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{(x+1)(y+1)}} \\ge \\frac{2}{x+y+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"232\" height=\"53\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a46a9040c2b0cbab957e2e93d1012bc8363005.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{(1 + \\sqrt{x})^2} + \\frac{1}{(1 + \\sqrt{y})^2} \\ge \\frac{2}{x+y+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"290\" height=\"44\" />, with equality happening when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/2961313d9872619a9f10419b469797e5abc30ac1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/9142c0ccf7e957a805bc7abcb09f664f79d954d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(j)=\\frac{1}{(1+\\sqrt{j})^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"140\" height=\"43\" />\nSince this function is concave up, according to Jensen's inequality, we can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcf0ac329fbdd39a51447d447444a6b61a88cf70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{f(x)+f(y)}{2}\\geq f(\\frac{x+y}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" /> which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d63472c3a144654f2ad49bc1633ea7566f4a4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f(y)\\geq 2f(\\frac{x+y}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"199\" height=\"37\" />.\nIn this problem, it turns into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3e1512972f826afef6c7af9da7b4513b826998.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f(y)\\geq \\frac{2}{(1+\\sqrt\\frac{x+y}{2})^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -31px\" width=\"222\" height=\"56\" />.The conclusion we try to find is that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0516b46c348186c93dd7e730674c987c4d9f82c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f(y) \\geq \\frac{2}{x+y+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"196\" height=\"42\" /> \nSo we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/f/73fb627aac2766ed007b29c203fbf7d3bc03b2e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{x+y+2} \\leq \\frac{2}{(1+\\sqrt\\frac{x+y}{2})^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -31px\" width=\"207\" height=\"56\" />.\nTake reciprocal for both sides we can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4b7839e7f4fb5337acac00f5ac8baa0cf5aad4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y+2)\\geq (1+\\sqrt\\frac{x+y}{2})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"231\" height=\"45\" />.\nTake RHS, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f84b562107a26e6f303040ef2eaa597828746f51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+\\sqrt\\frac{x+y}{2})^2=1+\\frac{x+y}{2}+\\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{x+y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"324\" height=\"45\" />.\nNow we have to prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/3/133f3c9b39a638230b9f840a44dfbeb2a0c56aeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y+2)\\geq (1+\\frac{x+y}{2}+\\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{x+y})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"309\" height=\"37\" />. \nwhich turns to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ef1955a5f0bbf833134c42140081f2b8628f7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{x+y}{2}+1)\\geq \\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{x+y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"199\" height=\"37\" />. It is always correct according to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6881c5aa54ff16ee44e9c045a7eb13c5dc303d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM-GM$\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" /> inequality, it happens when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/915f1781caa8b3e0eddafe7a445019f06178da22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/6/a762192e2b3bff585d2933aad39be2f86dfed97f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q.E.D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> ~bluesoul\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO\">2008 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215559\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 218/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7491/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.416      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    7.416      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:18416:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017215559 and revision id 167264. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}